cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "vp-human-dili: structure-based human drug-level DILI label prediction"
message: "Please cite this software and the clinical label sources documented in data/README.md."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Sagace Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sagace-Labs/vp-human-dili"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-04"
abstract: >-
  A counted-Morgan random forest predicts human drug-level DILI labels from
  molecular structure, with scaffold evaluation and an unseen FDA drug
  source-transfer check. Intended for research screening.
